     H*AN O-SPEC RECORD LINE NEEDS A RECORD TYPE IN POSITION 17 (IBM: RNF6005);
     H*E IS AN EXCEPTION RECORD, WRITTEN BY EXCEPT.
     FTESTFL158 O    F   20        DISK
     DAMT              S             10S 0
      /free
       AMT = 1;
       EXCEPT;
      /end-free
     C                   RETURN
     OTESTFL158
     O                       AMT                 10
